tel 1.0

# The Delta metadata-blob schema (LIRA specification §12.3): the atoms added, and the replaceable
# atoms replaced, by one lineage step. Mirror of the hand-encoded `LiraSchemas.delta`.

name lira-delta

record Replacement
  field old Hash
  field new Hash

scalar Hash
  validate base-256-hash

document
  field add Hash optional repeatable
  field replace Replacement optional repeatable
